      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OZA BUZZ (2) finished sixth last time at this track but could not have been more impressive before that in his brilliant 23.18 win at this track over 410m. Smart win two back and looks a key chance here. MANTIS BALE (1) jumped favourite and was too quick with an all-the-way win last start (26.45) at Geelong in a Bottom Up - Restricted Win over 460m. Has never been out of the placings from two starts out of this box. Has definite claims. DIMORA STRIPEY (3) had the drop on the lead from the rails draw last start but could only manage second, beaten 2.25 lengths (22.51) at Warrnambool in a Rank Limit - Grade 6 over 390m. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Must be included in calculations. MANILA JACK (6) is always a threat when he races at this journey.",
